      "value": "I have the Dell WMR HMD, and I love being able to use the joysticks for movement and the touchpads for gestures (actual controller tracking sucks because Bluetooth is bad =<). Moving is already how you want it to be (without acceleration because of nausea). However, the Vive wands touchpads make it hard to control your velocity and don't properly allow you to use gestures at the same time.",
